#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1234 expect=noViolation domain=DI
#note "FRESH (record-vs-value boundary, documents finding SD1234-F1). DEV1's DEVTYPE record has an empty DIVAL. The filter counts RECORDS with DIPARMCD=DEVTYPE regardless of DIVAL population -> \$devtype_count[DEV1]=1 -> silent."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DI label="Device Identifiers"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col SPDEVID  type=Char label="Sponsor Device Identifier"
col DISEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col DIPARMCD type=Char label="Device Parameter Short Name"
col DIPARM   type=Char label="Device Parameter"
col DIVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
---
S1 | DI | DEV1 | 1 | DEVTYPE | Device Type | 
S1 | DI | DEV1 | 2 | MODEL   | Model Number | M-100
S1 | DI | DEV2 | 1 | DEVTYPE | Device Type | CATHETER
